WEBVTT

00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:12.413
Come on, Newt. Get outta there.

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:20.546
(ROARING)

00:00:20.756 --> 00:00:21.881
(TOY TINKLING)

00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:27.136
(PURRING)

00:00:36.646 --> 00:00:37.855
(TINKLING)

00:00:43.236 --> 00:00:44.320
(GASPS)

00:00:49.493 --> 00:00:50.576
(ROARS)

00:00:53.914 --> 00:00:55.456
(CROWD MURMURING)

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:06.050
Come on!

00:01:37.999 --> 00:01:41.919
What were the three biggest mistakes
that you made last time?

00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:43.128
(STUDENTS MURMURING)

00:01:43.338 --> 00:01:44.880
- Caught by surprise, sir.
- DUMBLEDORE: Mmm.

00:01:45.215 --> 00:01:46.257
What else?

00:01:46.424 --> 00:01:47.925
Didn't parry before counter-curse, sir.

00:01:48.093 --> 00:01:50.594
Very good. The last one?

00:01:51.137 --> 00:01:53.764
The most important one?

00:01:56.768 --> 00:01:57.977
(STUDENTS GASP)

00:02:00.981 --> 00:02:03.023
Not learning from the first two.

00:02:03.108 --> 00:02:04.817
- (ALL LAUGHING)
- (DOOR OPENS)

00:02:05.986 --> 00:02:08.612
This is a school. You've no right.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.656
I'm the Head of Magical Law Enforcement.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:12.950
I have the right
to go wherever I please.

00:02:15.078 --> 00:02:16.495
Out of here.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:22.835
Go with Professor McGonagall, please.

00:02:24.754 --> 00:02:26.171
(STUDENTS MURMURING)

00:02:29.885 --> 00:02:31.677
He's the best teacher we've got.

00:02:31.845 --> 00:02:32.845
- Thanks, McClaggan.
- TRAVERS: Get out.

00:02:33.847 --> 00:02:35.180
Come, McClaggan.

00:02:39.311 --> 00:02:40.311
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.354
Newt Scamander is in Paris.

00:02:43.815 --> 00:02:44.815
Really?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.026
Cut the pretense.
I know he's there on your orders.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.153
Oh, if you'd ever had the pleasure
to teach him,

00:02:49.237 --> 00:02:52.031
you'd know Newt is not
a great follower of orders.

00:02:55.619 --> 00:02:57.578
You've read
<i>The Predictions of Tycho Dodonus?</i>

00:02:57.662 --> 00:02:59.163
Mmm. Many years ago.

00:02:59.873 --> 00:03:01.665
"A son cruelly banished

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:03.584
"Despair of the daughter

00:03:03.752 --> 00:03:05.294
- "Return..."
- Yes, I know it.

00:03:08.131 --> 00:03:10.716
There's a rumor this prediction
refers to the Obscurial.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.719
They say that Grindelwald wants...

00:03:13.887 --> 00:03:15.763
As a highborn henchman.
I've heard the rumor.

00:03:15.847 --> 00:03:18.641
And yet, Scamander appears
wherever the Obscurial goes,

00:03:19.976 --> 00:03:21.393
to protect him.

00:03:22.145 --> 00:03:23.395
Meanwhile, you've built up

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:26.732
quite the little network
of international contacts.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.152
However long you keep me
and my friends under surveillance,

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:33.656
you're not going to discover plots
against you, Travers,

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.407
because we want the same thing.

00:03:35.492 --> 00:03:37.409
The defeat of Grindelwald.

00:03:38.828 --> 00:03:39.954
(DUMBLEDORE SIGHS)

00:03:40.538 --> 00:03:44.458
But I warn you, your policies
of suppression and violence

00:03:45.251 --> 00:03:47.336
are pushing supporters into his arms.

00:03:47.504 --> 00:03:49.129
I'm not interested in your warnings.

00:03:51.633 --> 00:03:53.133
Now... (SIGHS)

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:58.013
It pains me to say it
because I don't like you...

00:03:58.223 --> 00:03:59.515
(BOTH LAUGH)

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.350
But...

00:04:03.269 --> 00:04:06.605
You are the only wizard
who is his equal.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.444
I need you to fight him.

00:04:18.201 --> 00:04:19.410
I can't.

00:04:23.623 --> 00:04:25.040
Because of this?

00:04:33.633 --> 00:04:36.176
You and Grindelwald
were as close as brothers.

00:04:37.971 --> 00:04:39.805
Oh, we were closer than brothers.

00:04:50.692 --> 00:04:53.110
Will you fight him?

00:04:55.196 --> 00:04:56.405
I can't.

00:04:57.949 --> 00:05:00.075
Well, then you have chosen your side.

00:05:03.163 --> 00:05:05.873
From now on,
I shall know every spell you cast.

00:05:06.249 --> 00:05:08.042
I'm doubling the watch on you,

00:05:08.209 --> 00:05:10.627
and you will no longer teach
Defense Against the Dark Arts.

00:05:13.006 --> 00:05:14.548
Where's Leta? We need to go to Paris.

00:05:20.972 --> 00:05:21.972
DUMBLEDORE: Theseus.

00:05:22.807 --> 00:05:25.017
Theseus, if Grindelwald calls a rally,

00:05:26.686 --> 00:05:27.811
don't try and break it up.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:30.272
Don't let Travers send you in there.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.400
If you ever trusted me...

00:05:33.568 --> 00:05:34.651
TRAVERS: Theseus.

00:05:35.779 --> 00:05:36.779
Theseus!

